  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato, carrot and capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with chermoula spice blend and season with a pinch of pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67feecb7ba6118bd6bcb7e58/step-79495000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber into half moons (see ingredients).\n• In a small bowl, combine the vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Add cucumber to pickling liquid. Add just enough water to cover the cucumber. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67feecb7ba6118bd6bcb7e58/step-523b0210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 10 minutes remaining, use your hands to break each spinach falafel into quarters (don't worry if they crumble!).\n• In a large frying pan, heat some olive oil (1/4 cup for 2 people/ 1/2 cup for 4 people) over medium high heat. When oil is hot, cook falafel pieces, tossing, until deep golden brown, 4-6 minutes (Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded).\n• Season generously, then transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67feecb7ba6118bd6bcb7e58/step-5f457020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a scond small bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt, dill & parsley mayonnaise and a splash of the pickling liquid. Season to taste. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67feecb7ba6118bd6bcb7e58/step-dd391130.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain pickled cucumber.\n• Transfer the slightly cooled roasted veggies to a bowl.\n• Add salad leaves and pickled cucumber. Drizzle with a little olive oil. Gently toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67feecb7ba6118bd6bcb7e58/step-c61ae840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Middle Eastern roast veggies between bowls. Top with falafel, some herby yoghurt and crumbled fetta cubes.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67feecb7ba6118bd6bcb7e58/step-88b28550.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
